  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the reported figure, there is a cyclic process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;on a sample of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> mol of a diatomic gas. The temperature of the gas during the process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>D</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;respectively.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0099_2056c0cb19dc.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 239px;\" /></p><p>Choose the correct option out of the following for work done if processes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></math> are adiabatic.</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub></math>",
